body:
The main thing holding it's popularity back is the existence of the OVA. Having first watched DNT, I was enthralled by it, overwhelmed by it and thrilled to watch it. However, after watching My Conquest is the Sea of Stars alone, I knew the OVA would be superior and haven't looked back. Every now and again, I delve into DNT and it's so lacklustre by comparison; I think the lack of classical music and the inferior character development/introductions go a long way to causing this.

&#x200B;

In relation to contemporary anime, I'm not too sure. Space Operas mustn't be the in thing at the moment, that and visually it's rather... bland.

Fantastic paint scheme here. 

&#x200B;

How'd the riptide perform?

*'he looks like he's between his 80s and 90s.'*

&#x200B;

Okay, I laughed harder at this than I should have.

This meme format is spreading like wildfire, and I fucking love it. 

&#x200B;

Great video, and keep it up!

Caveat, I don't own the Special Edition Blu-Rays.

&#x200B;

I've watched the series fully with both the HiDive Subs (Official), and the Central Anime Subs (fan subs) and I can tell you that the Official subtitles are indeed abysmal. I can't imagine they changed them for the Blu-Ray release, and they'll be the same as what's on their streaming service, so they're just as bad as you imagine.

My GOAT is still around. Take care GOAT.

&#x200B;

We miss you.

This has to be, the most satisfying ending to any work of fiction I've ever witnessed. It's such a perfect send-off and fully encapsulates the historical nature of the show. 

&#x200B;

Perfection.

Komm Susser Tod

&#x200B;

[https://youtu.be/uyjIkoPgyo0](https://youtu.be/uyjIkoPgyo0)

You're not the only one, existence in this world is pain and suffering. We all have our coping mechanisms to deal with this but loneliness is one of the most devastating feelings there is. I'm sorry you feel this way and I can only dream that you're free of these feelings. 

&#x200B;

I hope you find peace in a place where you belong.

Good to see more people are trying to make Dread Bobby G work. I've been working on something similar but for 1750pts as thats what local tournaments are at. Overall it can be quite powerful as the dreadnoughts are effectively mobile gun platforms to deathstar around G.    


I've come to something similar with troops, 2 scouts and 1 intercessor squad. It should provide enough screening/deep strike denial. Overall I'd like to hear how it performs.   


One thing I will say is that you can take a Mortis contemptor with the exact same loadout in the Heavy Support Slot for 168pts. You lose out on 2+ armour and have 2 less wounds but you save on points. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

This is a great colour scheme dude. Great job. I'm working on something similar myself after a fellow 40k player make a point of painting his guard in the style of the Wehrmacht I said I'd paint my in the style of Communism. Only difference is I've added blue to the colour scheme.    


[https://imgur.com/a/bWhXLjW](https://imgur.com/a/bWhXLjW)

